204
00:11:46,524 --> 00:11:49,584
They are, on paper, your most natural ally.

205
00:11:50,204 --> 00:11:54,164
In practice, they've spent one hundred and fifty years not noticing this,

206
00:11:54,644 --> 00:11:58,184
which makes them your most natural ally in the same way that a person sleeping

207
00:11:58,184 --> 00:12:01,544
