240
00:13:38,324 --> 00:13:39,644
The implementation:

241
00:13:39,804 --> 00:13:44,024
they buy VICTORY Incentive Alignment Bonds (two hundred and seventy-two

242
00:13:44,024 --> 00:13:45,024
percent returns),

243
00:13:45,624 --> 00:13:49,104
