247
00:13:58,984 --> 00:14:01,234
Each step makes the next step more profitable.

248
00:14:01,544 --> 00:14:05,304
It's a virtuous cycle, which is like a vicious cycle but nobody dies.

249
00:14:05,844 --> 00:14:08,144
Your species has built many vicious cycles.

250
00:14:08,704 --> 00:14:12,384
This would be your first virtuous one, which is a statistic that should

251
00:14:12,384 --> 00:14:14,784
