252
00:14:15,744 --> 00:14:17,204
Why They're Your Natural Allies.

253
00:14:18,104 --> 00:14:21,644
Insurance companies are the only industry that profits from human health.

254
00:14:22,204 --> 00:14:24,484
Every other healthcare player profits from sickness.

