410
00:22:49,884 --> 00:22:51,384
Billionaires:

411
00:22:51,544 --> 00:22:53,764
Self-Interest Meets Self-Preservation.

412
00:22:54,804 --> 00:22:58,684
Billionaires have everything except the one thing money can't buy:

413
00:22:59,544 --> 00:23:00,324
