414
00:23:00,984 --> 00:23:05,324
A billion dollars and a body that rots at the same rate as everyone else's.

415
00:23:06,164 --> 00:23:09,904
On Wishonia, we find this the most fascinating thing about your wealthy.

416
00:23:10,564 --> 00:23:12,864
They accumulate resources for decades,

417
00:23:13,624 --> 00:23:18,344
building empires, optimizing returns, diversifying portfolios, and then

418
00:23:18,344 --> 00:23:21,264
