00:23:48,764 --> 00:23:52,404
And the part they won't say out loud but think every time their knee hurts:

430
00:23:52,924 --> 00:23:57,264
they're getting old, their genetics aren't special, and every disease cured

431
00:23:57,264 --> 00:24:00,064
