432
00:24:01,364 --> 00:24:05,244
Your species' billionaires have been funding vanity projects for decades.

433
00:24:05,964 --> 00:24:06,764
Space tourism.

434
00:24:07,124 --> 00:24:08,324
Underwater hotels.

435
00:24:08,664 --> 00:24:09,264
Islands.

