437
00:24:12,304 --> 00:24:13,044
This does.

438
00:24:13,364 --> 00:24:16,874
It's the first vanity project where the vanity is rational.

439
00:24:17,664 --> 00:24:18,424
The Domino Effect.

440
00:24:19,324 --> 00:24:24,044
Insurance companies move first, because pure financial logic is their entire

441
